    "turn_text": "Yeah, it's good. I mean, Gable and his wife, Kathy, they're Republicans. They're good folks. So we had that friendship with them here, but particularly when Gable got the Medal of Freedom and President Trump presented it to him. We were there at the White House with him and his family. So it was kind of fun to see them. And then John Smith, of course, the legendary coach Oklahoma State. So we had a good time. Had a good time.",
