    "turn_idx": 88,
    "turn_text": "Greg question we look that we first is get the facts on the table make sure the country knows fully what has been going on in their government that they pay for many times with their tax money being sent out to these these not-for-profits and others who are also influencing in trying to limit speech so get all the facts on the table then propose legislation that will fix that situation and and I think this is an important and and look at the appropriations process which is all the spending and taxing bills, the way the founders set this great country up, the greatest nation ever, they set it up so that the spending and taxing starts in the Congress, in the legislative branch, and specifically within the House of Representatives. So use the appropriations process, the power, the purse, to also make sure that these agencies aren't being turned against the very people that they're supposed to serve.",
